// Which of the game's adult heads and bodies are for elders.
//
// A head's or body's name is shown under the panel in Create a Sim, for example "c005ma_kaj" or
// "b800fafit_eldenmama", and a head's under the heads in the head picker. Capitals do not matter. One
// name covers every skin colour.
//
//   "elder"  only for elders: taken out of Adult in Create a Sim, and not given to a child who grows up.
//   "both"   for adults and for elders: helmets, bald heads and others that suit either.
//
// Elders are offered what is in the two lists. If neither has a head (or a body) of a Sim's sex, they
// are offered every adult one.
